//@version=6
// The VWAP desk's three setups in one strategy, mirroring
// pwb_toolbox/backtesting/vwap.py (VwapStrategy). Change a rule there, change
// it here; tests hold the Python side, TradingView holds this one.
//
// VWAP and its bands are accumulated by hand from an anchor TIME rather than
// taken from ta.vwap: ta.vwap resets at the instrument's session boundary
// (18:00 ET on CME futures), while the fade numbers this implements are
// quoted off a 09:30 anchor. Hand accumulation keeps the two readings of the
// strategy computing the same line.
//
// Setups: "fade" (close outside +/-k sigma enters toward VWAP -- the one with
// empirical support), "pullback" (touch of VWAP from the prior close's side,
// close back across, ride toward the far band), "cross" (close crosses VWAP,
// stop-and-reverse -- the retail favorite, kept as a CONTROL because the
// published sweeps found it worthless; if it wins here, distrust the harness
// or the data before the conclusion).
strategy("VWAP Setups", overlay = true, initial_capital = 100000,
     default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1,
     commission_type = strategy.commission.cash_per_contract,
     commission_value = 2.50, slippage = 1)

setup       = input.string("fade", "Setup", options = ["fade", "pullback", "cross"])
bandK       = input.float(2.0, "Band width (sigma)", minval = 0.1)
stopK       = input.float(1.0, "Stop distance (sigma past signal)", minval = 0.1)
anchorStart = input.session("0930-1555", "Session (anchor + trading window)")
warmupMin   = input.int(30, "Warmup minutes before entries", minval = 0)
useRvol     = input.bool(false, "Relative-volume gate")
rvolLen     = input.int(50, "  rvol SMA length", minval = 1)
rvolMin     = input.float(1.5, "  rvol minimum", minval = 0.0)
useDayType  = input.bool(false, "Day-type gate (first 30 min)")
dayTypeBp   = input.float(30.0, "  trend-day threshold (bp)", minval = 0.0)
useMa       = input.bool(false, "MA side gate")
maLen       = input.int(200, "  MA length", minval = 1)
useRsi      = input.bool(false, "RSI control gate (fades only)")
rsiLen      = input.int(14, "  RSI length", minval = 2)

inSession   = not na(time(timeframe.period, anchorStart, "America/New_York"))
newSession  = inSession and not inSession[1]

// --- VWAP + volume-weighted sigma bands, anchored at the session open -------
var float sumV   = 0.0
var float sumPV  = 0.0
var float sumPV2 = 0.0
var float sumP   = 0.0
var float sumP2  = 0.0
var int   nBars  = 0
var float sessionOpen = na
var int   sessionT0   = na
if newSession
    sumV := 0.0, sumPV := 0.0, sumPV2 := 0.0, sumP := 0.0, sumP2 := 0.0
    nBars := 0
    sessionOpen := open
    sessionT0 := time
if inSession
    sumV := sumV + volume
    sumPV := sumPV + hlc3 * volume
    sumPV2 := sumPV2 + hlc3 * hlc3 * volume
    sumP := sumP + hlc3
    sumP2 := sumP2 + hlc3 * hlc3
    nBars := nBars + 1

// Zero-volume feeds degrade to TWAP instead of dividing by zero -- same rule
// as the Python side, and the same warning applies to the result.
float vwapVal = sumV > 0 ? sumPV / sumV : nBars > 0 ? sumP / nBars : na
float variance = sumV > 0 ? sumPV2 / sumV - vwapVal * vwapVal :
     nBars > 0 ? sumP2 / nBars - vwapVal * vwapVal : na
float sigma = na(variance) ? na : math.sqrt(math.max(variance, 0.0))
float upper = vwapVal + bandK * sigma
float lower = vwapVal - bandK * sigma

plot(inSession ? vwapVal : na, "VWAP", color.orange, 2)
plot(inSession ? upper : na, "Upper", color.new(color.orange, 60))
plot(inSession ? lower : na, "Lower", color.new(color.orange, 60))

// --- confirms ----------------------------------------------------------------
float rvolAvg = ta.sma(volume, rvolLen)
bool rvolOk = not useRvol or (rvolAvg > 0 and volume / rvolAvg >= rvolMin)
float maVal = ta.sma(close, maLen)
maOkLong  = not useMa or close > maVal
maOkShort = not useMa or close < maVal
float rsiVal = ta.rsi(close, rsiLen)
rsiOkLong  = not useRsi or rsiVal < 30
rsiOkShort = not useRsi or rsiVal > 70

elapsedMin = na(sessionT0) ? 0 : (time - sessionT0) / 60000
warm = inSession and elapsedMin >= warmupMin and sigma > 0

// Day type from the first 30 session minutes (market intraday momentum,
// Gao/Han/Li/Zhou JFE 2018): a trend day blocks counter-trend fades and
// off-trend pullbacks. 0 = undecided, 1/-1 = trend, 2 = range.
var int dayType = 0
if newSession
    dayType := 0
if useDayType and dayType == 0 and elapsedMin >= 30 and not na(sessionOpen)
    retBp = 10000 * (close[1] / sessionOpen - 1)
    dayType := retBp >= dayTypeBp ? 1 : retBp <= -dayTypeBp ? -1 : 2
classified = not useDayType or dayType != 0
allowLong  = not useDayType or dayType == 2 or dayType == 1
allowShort = not useDayType or dayType == 2 or dayType == -1

// --- setups ------------------------------------------------------------------
var float stopLevel = na
flat = strategy.position_size == 0

if warm and classified and flat
    if setup == "fade"
        if close > upper and allowShort and rvolOk and maOkShort and rsiOkShort
            stopLevel := close + stopK * sigma
            strategy.entry("S", strategy.short)
        else if close < lower and allowLong and rvolOk and maOkLong and rsiOkLong
            stopLevel := close - stopK * sigma
            strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
    else if setup == "pullback"
        if close[1] > vwapVal[1] and low <= vwapVal and close > vwapVal and allowLong and rvolOk and maOkLong
            stopLevel := vwapVal - stopK * sigma
            strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
        else if close[1] < vwapVal[1] and high >= vwapVal and close < vwapVal and allowShort and rvolOk and maOkShort
            stopLevel := vwapVal + stopK * sigma
            strategy.entry("S", strategy.short)
    else
        if close > vwapVal and close[1] <= vwapVal[1]
            strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
        else if close < vwapVal and close[1] >= vwapVal[1]
            strategy.entry("S", strategy.short)

// Exits are decided on closes and fill at the next open, matching the Python
// side's honest reading of how a market order actually fills.
if not flat
    if setup == "fade"
        if strategy.position_size > 0 and (close >= vwapVal or close <= stopLevel)
            strategy.close_all(close <= stopLevel ? "stop" : "target")
        else if strategy.position_size < 0 and (close <= vwapVal or close >= stopLevel)
            strategy.close_all(close >= stopLevel ? "stop" : "target")
    else if setup == "pullback"
        if strategy.position_size > 0 and (close >= upper or close <= stopLevel)
            strategy.close_all(close <= stopLevel ? "stop" : "target")
        else if strategy.position_size < 0 and (close <= lower or close >= stopLevel)
            strategy.close_all(close >= stopLevel ? "stop" : "target")
    else
        if strategy.position_size > 0 and close < vwapVal and close[1] >= vwapVal[1]
            strategy.close_all("reverse")
            strategy.entry("S", strategy.short)
        else if strategy.position_size < 0 and close > vwapVal and close[1] <= vwapVal[1]
            strategy.close_all("reverse")
            strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)

// Flat outside the window: cancel anything unfilled, close anything open.
if not inSession and inSession[1]
    strategy.cancel_all()
    strategy.close_all("flatten")
